  "title": "Visual Naming EC",
  "description": "This dataset contains intracranial EEG (iEEG) recordings from 110 individuals performing a visual naming task. Electrode coordinates are provided in MNI-305 space, and events mark stimulus onset and response onset. The data were used in an analysis of whole-brain, millisecond-scale effective connectivity atlases of speech.",
  "methods_description": "Intracranial EEG was recorded from 110 subjects performing a visual-naming task. Each EDF file includes event codes marking stimulus onset (401) and response onset (501). Electrode coordinates were localized in MNI-305 standardized space.",
